  "details": "* HUD Hidden\nIt is useful to turn off the HUD when playing the game world.\n* Mirror resolution\nIn Pimax, the mirror resolution must be infinite to be sharp.\n* Smooth camera screen\nWhen broadcasting, I have to turn it on every day...\n* Culling mode\nIn Pimax, there's an issue where the world is partially cut off in the default culling mode.\nTo solve this, I change the culling mode, and I have to press a button every time you turn on the game.\nThese settings should be set every time you restart the game.\nEvery day I turn on the game, I spend time setting it up one by one.",
